(264,'4f4072e0-1bb1-47e9-98fa-4f1a21e3f787',NULL,'registered','1782990174716-7506','assistant','THOUGHT: The user wants the teacher, Mr. Sharifi, to provide clues to the children. I need to explain *how* he might do this, connecting it to his personality and the story\'s setting/theme. I should offer a specific way he could give a clue and then ask the user to choose or elaborate.\n\n1.  **Acknowledge and confirm:** Confirm that having the teacher give clues is a great idea.\n2.  **Connect to personality/role:** Relate this to Mr. Sharifi\'s role as an experienced teacher in an old school.\n3.  **Brainstorm clue types from a teacher:**\n    *   Knowledge of the school\'s history/secrets.\n    *   A specific memory.\n    *   An object.\n    *   A piece of advice.\n4.  **Offer a specific, engaging scenario:** Give a concrete example of how he might provide a clue related to the \"lost cup\" and the \"old school in Yazd.\"\n5.  **Engage the user:** Ask the user to choose or elaborate on the type of clue.','gemini-2.5-flash',4406,'{\"promptTokenCount\":8722,\"candidatesTokenCount\":575,\"totalTokenCount\":9297,\"cachedContentTokenCount\":7978,\"promptTokensDetails\":[{\"modality\":\"TEXT\",\"tokenCount\":8722}],\"cacheTokensDetails\":[{\"modality\":\"TEXT\",\"tokenCount\":7978}],\"serviceTier\":\"standard\"}',NULL,'plan_allowed','2026-07-03 04:57:26'),
