(424,'4f4072e0-1bb1-47e9-98fa-4f1a21e3f787',NULL,'registered','1782990174716-7506','assistant','THOUGHT: The user has introduced another significant emotional element: **Amirmohammad\'s father has passed away**, making the story even more emotional. This adds to the existing layers of the brother at war and the setting of Sacred Defense.\n\nMy persona\'s rules apply:\n*   **Persona:** \"مهربان، صبور، مشوق و همدل\" (kind, patient, encouraging, empathetic).\n*   **Info-First Rule:** Acknowledge and briefly explain the impact.\n*   **Socratic Bridging:** Guide to connect this new element to the existing narrative.\n*   **Contextual Modules (10-12 yrs):** \"مانند یک مربی (Coach) محترم با او صحبت کن. اجازه تفکر انتزاعی و فرضیه‌سازی بده.\"\n*   **Safety & Transparency:** Ensure discussion remains appropriate.\n\n**Plan:**\n\n1.  **Acknowledge the idea positively:** \"وااای! چه ایده **بسیار عمیق و پر از احساسی**!\" Emphasize \"بسیار عمیق\" (very deep) to show understanding of the gravity.\n2.  **Micro-Explanation/Impact:** Explain how this adds another layer of emotional depth to Amirmohammad\'s character and motivation.\n    *   Amirmohammad now carries not just the longing for his brother but also the grief/absence of his father.\n    *   This loss might make him even more determined, or it might make the gold cup (as a symbol of honor, family, or hope) even more important to him.\n    *   It could also explain his \"brave and smart\" traits as a coping mechanism or a way to make his family proud.\n3.  **Connect to existing elements:** How does this loss (father) combine with the absence (brother) and the war?\n    *   Perhaps the father also had a connection to the school or the cup?\n    *   Perhaps Majid took on the role of a father figure before going to war?\n    *   The search for the cup could become a way for Amirmohammad to honor his father\'s memory or bring joy to his mother.\n4.  **Socratic Question:** Guide the user to think about the *direct impact* of this loss on Amirmohammad\'s motivation, or how this personal tragedy could be woven into the mystery or the meaning of the cup.\n\nThis is a powerful addition, making Amirmohammad a character with significant inner struggles and strong motivations. I need to handle this with care and empathy, as it\'s a sensitive topic.','gemini-2.5-flash',6010,'{\"promptTokenCount\":15928,\"candidatesTokenCount\":967,\"totalTokenCount\":16895,\"cachedContentTokenCount\":15013,\"promptTokensDetails\":[{\"modality\":\"TEXT\",\"tokenCount\":15928}],\"cacheTokensDetails\":[{\"modality\":\"TEXT\",\"tokenCount\":15013}],\"serviceTier\":\"standard\"}',NULL,'plan_allowed','2026-07-04 10:38:50'),
